        {
          "id": "R-070",
          "text": "Borrower document ingestion fidelity is unspecified and no sample documents were supplied: whether the document extraction stage must parse real uploaded PDFs/scans/spreadsheets, or operates on structured/typed financial input with documents attached for reference only.",
